{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;A Table. Some Cards. One Goal: Don\u2019t Get Stabbed.&quot;</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i> </i></strong> <strong>Welcome to Stab Club</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat at the table with the Stab Bots, quirky robotic players built for competition. Everyone\u2019s smiling\u2026 until someone gets stabbed! Match the cards that increase each other\u2019s stab points to trade blows in this turn-based tabletop card game. The one with the most stab points at the end? Out! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Rules, Brutal Outcomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you\u2019ll draw, plan, and play cards to shift the balance. Timing and table awareness are crucial when attacking, defending, or rerouting the stabs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Table Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games are quick, but the grudges last. One bad call could turn the tables on you, and one lucky draw could change the outcome. No two matches ever end the same. Every stab leaves its mark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Friends at This Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is a luxury. Every card played could betray you, even from the Stab Bots!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against AI Stab Bots or challenge your friends in local or online matches.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119310?t=1766502255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119310?t=1766502255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119310/da91baf16a24b5572e3f6bd28ff4b9c16079f62d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766502255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119310/da91baf16a24b5572e3f6bd28ff4